      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Ernoto stacks open cubes into a tower, with a pink spiral tube slide on one side and a net crawl tunnel on the other. Children climb from cube to cube, crawl through the net tunnel and take the slide down, so the tower suits active groups who like to explore. It holds 30 to 35 children and its product area is 23'9\" x 23'2\", almost square. That shape fits the centre of a society garden or a square school yard. Skills listed for Ernoto include exploring, building strength and emotional intelligence. It comes in a multi-colour scheme as part of our NexLev Abstract series. Galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope are covered for 3 years. Ask us for a layout drawing with the safe zone marked."
     }
